Package: mailficient
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: uk2010 <uk2010@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Depends: gpg, libc6, libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), libgee-0.8-2, libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.76), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12), libjson-glib-1.0-0, libsecret-1-0, libsqlite3-0, libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, libxml2-16
Recommends: gnome-keyring, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Homepage: https://github.com/uk2010/mailficient
Description: Native GTK email client
 Mailficient is a native GTK4 and Libadwaita desktop email client with
 standard IMAP and SMTP support, secure credential storage, offline mail,
 search, drafts, attachments, and safe HTML message display.
